Package: CGMAnalyzerShiny
Title: Shiny Application for Continuous Glucose Monitoring Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Shubh", "Saraswat", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "shubh.saraswat00@gmail.com")
    )
Author: Shubh Saraswat [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Shubh Saraswat <shubh.saraswat00@gmail.com>
Description: A modular Shiny application for continuous glucose monitoring
    data upload, quality control, preprocessing, clinically relevant CGM
    metrics, visual analytics, nonlinear complexity analysis, and statistical
    comparison. The application prefers CGManalyzer for standard CGM
    analysis, uses iglu selectively for gaps or validation, and can use a
    current GitHub version of CGMissingDataR that exports
    run_missing_glucose_imputation() for missing glucose imputation workflows.
